### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Get all products
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### 2. Search products by name (Query String)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?name=mouse

### 3. Get single product by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1

### 4. Get product by non-existent ID (Returns 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/999

### 5. Create a new product (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard",
  "price": 2500,
  "quantity": 3
}

### 6. Create product with invalid payload (Returns 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Incomplete Product"
}

### 7. Update an existing product (PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "RGB Mechanical Keyboard",
  "price": 1500,
  "quantity": 5
}

### 8. Update non-existent product (Returns 404)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ghost Item",
  "price": 100,
  "quantity": 1
}

### 9. Delete a product (DELETE)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/2

### 10. Delete non-existent product (Returns 404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/999
